{"seq":2,"slug":"hit-detection","title":"命中检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/hit-detection","wordCount":1096,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"命中检测\">命中检测</h1><p>在 DOM 里，点击一个按钮，浏览器自动派发 click 事件给那个元素——因为 DOM 是保留模式，每个元素都是有边界、有身份的对象。Canvas 不是。你画的圆、矩形、自定义图标，画完就化成了一片没有身份的像素，浏览器只知道「canvas 这个元素被点了」，至于点在了哪个图形上，它一无所知。要让 Canvas 图形可交互，「这个点落在哪个图元上」这个问题必须由你自己回答。这就是命中检测（hit detection / picking），它是即时模式那笔债里最硬的一笔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>命中检测的输入是一个点（通常来自鼠标/触摸事件），输出是「它命中了哪个对象」。一切的第一步都相同：把事件的屏幕坐标换算成画布逻辑坐标，因为图形可能画在被平移、缩放、旋转过的坐标系里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;pointer 事件 clientX/clientY&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;减去 canvas 边界&lt;br/&gt;getBoundingClientRect&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;逆变换回逻辑坐标&lt;br/&gt;CTM 的逆矩阵&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;选择命中策略&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;规则形状&quot;| E[&quot;几何法&lt;br/&gt;圆/矩形数学判定&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;任意路径&quot;| F[&quot;isPointInPath / isPointInStroke&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;海量/复杂图元&quot;| G[&quot;离屏取色拾取&lt;br/&gt;颜色 ID 映射&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;命中的对象 → 派发交互&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"pointer 事件 clientX/clientY\"] --&gt; B[\"减去 canvas 边界&lt;br/&gt;getBoundingClientRect\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"逆变换回逻辑坐标&lt;br/&gt;CTM 的逆矩阵\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"选择命中策略\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"规则形状\"| E[\"几何法&lt;br/&gt;圆/矩形数学判定\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"任意路径\"| F[\"isPointInPath / isPointInStroke\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"海量/复杂图元\"| G[\"离屏取色拾取&lt;br/&gt;颜色 ID 映射\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"命中的对象 → 派发交互\"]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>坐标换算这一步绕不开第一章的逆变换：若绘制是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&#x27;=Mp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，拾取就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>p</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=M^{-1}p&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，细节见<a href=\"../foundations/coordinate-transforms\">坐标系与变换</a>。下面三种策略，区别只在「拿到逻辑坐标后怎么判命中」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略一-几何法\">策略一：几何法</h2><p>对圆、矩形、线段这类有解析公式的规则形状，直接用数学判定最快。点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在圆心 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(c_x,c_y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的圆内，当且仅当：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-c_x)^2 + (y-c_y)^2 \\le r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1502em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>点在轴对齐矩形内则是四个边界比较。注意上式刻意不开平方，省一次 <code>sqrt</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function hitCircle(p, c) {&#10;  const dx = p.x - c.x,&#10;    dy = p.y - c.y;&#10;  return dx * dx + dy * dy &lt;= c.r * c.r;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hitCircle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    dy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>几何法极快、零额外内存，但只适用于你能写出公式的形状；遇到任意贝塞尔轮廓就无能为力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略二-ispointinpath-与-ispointinstroke\">策略二：isPointInPath 与 isPointInStroke</h2><p>对任意复杂路径，浏览器内置了判定器。<code>ctx.isPointInPath(x, y)</code> 判断点是否在当前路径（或传入的 <code>Path2D</code>）的填充区域内，<code>ctx.isPointInStroke(x, y)</code> 判断是否落在描边线上。它们会考虑当前的填充规则与变换，省去你手写几何。配合上一章<a href=\"../rendering/paths-shapes\">路径与形状</a>里讲的 <code>Path2D</code>，可以把每个对象的几何存成一个 <code>Path2D</code>，命中时逐个测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"for (const obj of objects) {&#10;  if (ctx.isPointInPath(obj.path, x, y)) return obj; // x,y 已转逻辑坐标&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> obj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> objects) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isPointInPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj.path, x, y)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// x,y 已转逻辑坐标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代价是：每次检测都要对每个对象调一次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，对象一多就慢；而且它依赖当前上下文状态，跨变换使用时要小心对齐坐标系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略三-离屏取色拾取\">策略三：离屏取色拾取</h2><p>当图元成百上千、形状又不规则时，逐个 <code>isPointInPath</code> 太慢。经典解法是「颜色拾取」（color picking）：维护一块与主画布同尺寸的离屏画布，把每个对象用一种<strong>唯一纯色</strong>重画一遍（颜色即对象 ID），命中时只需 <code>getImageData</code> 读出鼠标处那一个像素的颜色，反查就是被点的对象——一次像素读取，与对象数量无关。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 离屏画布上：每个对象用 id 编码成唯一颜色绘制&#10;function idToColor(id) {&#10;  return `rgb(${id &amp; 255}, ${(id &gt;&gt; 8) &amp; 255}, ${(id &gt;&gt; 16) &amp; 255})`;&#10;}&#10;// 命中：读鼠标处 1 像素，解码回 id&#10;const [r, g, b] = pickCtx.getImageData(x, y, 1, 1).data;&#10;const id = r | (g &lt;&lt; 8) | (b &lt;&lt; 16);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 离屏画布上：每个对象用 id 编码成唯一颜色绘制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idToColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `rgb(${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 255</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, ${</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 255</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, ${</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 255</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 命中：读鼠标处 1 像素，解码回 id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pickCtx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, y, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这块离屏画布天然适合用 <code>willReadFrequently:true</code> 创建，避免每次取色都触发 GPU 回读——这正是<a href=\"../rendering/pixel-manipulation\">像素操作</a>里讲的读回优化在交互场景的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种策略的权衡\">三种策略的权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>内存</th>\n<th>适用形状</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>几何法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，单次极快</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>圆/矩形/线等可解析</td>\n<td>图表节点、简单 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>isPointInPath</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，单次中等</td>\n<td>路径对象</td>\n<td>任意路径</td>\n<td>中等数量不规则图形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离屏取色</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 拾取</td>\n<td>一块离屏画布</td>\n<td>任意（含位图）</td>\n<td>海量图元、复杂热区地图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中常组合使用：先用对象包围盒（bounding box）做几何法粗筛，把候选缩小到几个，再对候选用 <code>isPointInPath</code> 精判——这种「粗筛 + 精判」是兼顾速度与精度的常用模式，也和<a href=\"scene-management\">场景管理</a>里的空间索引、以及<a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a>里的剔除思想一脉相承。命中结果通常在<a href=\"animation-loop\">动画循环</a>的 update 阶段被消费，转化为状态变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>即时模式下画布无对象身份，「点命中了谁」必须自己算；第一步永远是把屏幕坐标经逆变换换回逻辑坐标。</li>\n<li>几何法对圆/矩形等可解析形状最快、零内存（圆用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-c_x)^2+(y-c_y)^2\\le r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1002em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，免开方）。</li>\n<li><code>isPointInPath</code>/<code>isPointInStroke</code> 处理任意路径，配 <code>Path2D</code> 逐对象测试，但是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>离屏取色拾取把对象编码成唯一颜色，命中时读 1 像素反查，拾取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，适合海量/不规则图元；离屏画布宜开 <code>willReadFrequently</code>。</li>\n<li>实战常「包围盒粗筛 + isPointInPath 精判」组合，兼顾速度与精度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"命中检测","id":"命中检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"策略一：几何法","id":"策略一-几何法"},{"level":2,"text":"策略二：isPointInPath 与 isPointInStroke","id":"策略二-ispointinpath-与-ispointinstroke"},{"level":2,"text":"策略三：离屏取色拾取","id":"策略三-离屏取色拾取"},{"level":2,"text":"三种策略的权衡","id":"三种策略的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动画循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/animation-loop"},"next":{"title":"场景管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/scene-management"}}